    user_response: "Now focus on FUNCTIONAL DEMONSTRATION rather than visual redesign.\n\nCreate a fully simulated end-to-end workflow using frontend mock data/local state.\n\nDemonstrate this exact journey:\n\nCitizen:\nReport pothole\n\342\206\222 photo uploaded\n\342\206\222 GPS captured\n\342\206\222 Tamil/English description entered\n\342\206\222 AI identifies \342\200\234Pothole\342\200\235\n\342\206\222 report submitted\n\342\206\222 Issue ID generated\n\nSystem:\n\342\206\222 detects 42 similar reports\n\342\206\222 merges them into ONE canonical civic issue\n\342\206\222 calculates priority as HIGH\n\342\206\222 determines Ward 37\n\342\206\222 routes to Roads Department\n\342\206\222 assigns Field Team B\n\nGovernment:\n\342\206\222 officer sees the issue in the queue\n\342\206\222 opens issue detail\n\342\206\222 assigns team\n\342\206\222 starts work\n\342\206\222 uploads after-photo\n\342\206\222 marks issue \342\200\234Awaiting Citizen Verification\342\200\235\n\nCitizen:\n\342\206\222 receives notification\n\342\206\222 opens issue\n\342\206\222 compares before/after\n\342\206\222 confirms resolution\n\nFinally:\n\342\206\222 issue becomes CLOSED\n\342\206\222 analytics update automatically\n\342\206\222 issue contributes to recurring hotspot statistics\n\nMake every major button in this demo flow actually change the frontend state.\n\nDo not create fake navigation that leads nowhere.\nMake the prototype feel like one connected system.Now focus on FUNCTIONAL DEMONSTRATION rather than visual redesign.\n\nCreate a fully simulated end-to-end workflow using frontend mock data/local state.\n\nDemonstrate this exact journey:\n\nCitizen:\nReport pothole\n\342\206\222 photo uploaded\n\342\206\222 GPS captured\n\342\206\222 Tamil/English description entered\n\342\206\222 AI identifies \342\200\234Pothole\342\200\235\n\342\206\222 report submitted\n\342\206\222 Issue ID generated\n\nSystem:\n\342\206\222 detects 42 similar reports\n\342\206\222 merges them into ONE canonical civic issue\n\342\206\222 calculates priority as HIGH\n\342\206\222 determines Ward 37\n\342\206\222 routes to Roads Department\n\342\206\222 assigns Field Team B\n\nGovernment:\n\342\206\222 officer sees the issue in the queue\n\342\206\222 opens issue detail\n\342\206\222 assigns team\n\342\206\222 starts work\n\342\206\222 uploads after-photo\n\342\206\222 marks issue \342\200\234Awaiting Citizen Verification\342\200\235\n\nCitizen:\n\342\206\222 receives notification\n\342\206\222 opens issue\n\342\206\222 compares before/after\n\342\206\222 confirms resolution\n\nFinally:\n\342\206\222 issue becomes CLOSED\n\342\206\222 analytics update automatically\n\342\206\222 issue contributes to recurring hotspot statistics\n\nMake every major button in this demo flow actually change the frontend state.\n\nDo not create fake navigation that leads nowhere.\nMake the prototype feel like one connected system."
    items {
      text: "Now focus on FUNCTIONAL DEMONSTRATION rather than visual redesign.\n\nCreate a fully simulated end-to-end workflow using frontend mock data/local state.\n\nDemonstrate this exact journey:\n\nCitizen:\nReport pothole\n\342\206\222 photo uploaded\n\342\206\222 GPS captured\n\342\206\222 Tamil/English description entered\n\342\206\222 AI identifies \342\200\234Pothole\342\200\235\n\342\206\222 report submitted\n\342\206\222 Issue ID generated\n\nSystem:\n\342\206\222 detects 42 similar reports\n\342\206\222 merges them into ONE canonical civic issue\n\342\206\222 calculates priority as HIGH\n\342\206\222 determines Ward 37\n\342\206\222 routes to Roads Department\n\342\206\222 assigns Field Team B\n\nGovernment:\n\342\206\222 officer sees the issue in the queue\n\342\206\222 opens issue detail\n\342\206\222 assigns team\n\342\206\222 starts work\n\342\206\222 uploads after-photo\n\342\206\222 marks issue \342\200\234Awaiting Citizen Verification\342\200\235\n\nCitizen:\n\342\206\222 receives notification\n\342\206\222 opens issue\n\342\206\222 compares before/after\n\342\206\222 confirms resolution\n\nFinally:\n\342\206\222 issue becomes CLOSED\n\342\206\222 analytics update automatically\n\342\206\222 issue contributes to recurring hotspot statistics\n\nMake every major button in this demo flow actually change the frontend state.\n\nDo not create fake navigation that leads nowhere.\nMake the prototype feel like one connected system.Now focus on FUNCTIONAL DEMONSTRATION rather than visual redesign.\n\nCreate a fully simulated end-to-end workflow using frontend mock data/local state.\n\nDemonstrate this exact journey:\n\nCitizen:\nReport pothole\n\342\206\222 photo uploaded\n\342\206\222 GPS captured\n\342\206\222 Tamil/English description entered\n\342\206\222 AI identifies \342\200\234Pothole\342\200\235\n\342\206\222 report submitted\n\342\206\222 Issue ID generated\n\nSystem:\n\342\206\222 detects 42 similar reports\n\342\206\222 merges them into ONE canonical civic issue\n\342\206\222 calculates priority as HIGH\n\342\206\222 determines Ward 37\n\342\206\222 routes to Roads Department\n\342\206\222 assigns Field Team B\n\nGovernment:\n\342\206\222 officer sees the issue in the queue\n\342\206\222 opens issue detail\n\342\206\222 assigns team\n\342\206\222 starts work\n\342\206\222 uploads after-photo\n\342\206\222 marks issue \342\200\234Awaiting Citizen Verification\342\200\235\n\nCitizen:\n\342\206\222 receives notification\n\342\206\222 opens issue\n\342\206\222 compares before/after\n\342\206\222 confirms resolution\n\nFinally:\n\342\206\222 issue becomes CLOSED\n\342\206\222 analytics update automatically\n\342\206\222 issue contributes to recurring hotspot statistics\n\nMake every major button in this demo flow actually change the frontend state.\n\nDo not create fake navigation that leads nowhere.\nMake the prototype feel like one connected system."
