  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Now strengthen the prototype\'s UNIQUE PRODUCT DIFFERENTIATORS.\n\nDo not redesign the entire application.\n\nMake these concepts visibly understandable inside the existing UI:\n\n1. REPORT \342\211\240 ISSUE\n\nShow that multiple citizen reports can be consolidated into one physical civic issue.\n\nExample:\n\342\200\23442 Citizen Reports\342\200\235\n\342\206\222\n\342\200\2341 Canonical Civic Issue\342\200\235\n\n2. AI TRIAGE\n\nShow:\nIssue classification confidence\nDuplicate probability\nSpam/trust score\nPriority score\n\n3. JURISDICTION INTELLIGENCE\n\nShow:\nGPS\n\342\206\222 Ward\n\342\206\222 Municipality\n\342\206\222 Responsible Department\n\342\206\222 Field Team\n\n4. CAPACITY-AWARE PRIORITIZATION\n\nShow why an issue is prioritized using:\nSeverity\nCitizen impact\nNumber of reports\nLocation risk\nSLA\nDepartment workload\n\n5. EVIDENCE-BACKED RESOLUTION\n\nShow:\nBefore photo\n+\nAfter photo\n+\nCompletion timestamp\n\n6. CITIZEN-VERIFIED CLOSURE\n\nShow:\nDepartment marks resolved\n\342\206\222 Citizen verifies\n\342\206\222 Closed\n\nor:\nCitizen rejects\n\342\206\222 Reopened\n\n7. RECURRING INFRASTRUCTURE INTELLIGENCE\n\nShow:\nRepeated issues at the same location over time\n\342\206\222 Hotspot\n\342\206\222 Preventive maintenance recommendation\n\nUse compact \342\200\234Why?\342\200\235 / \342\200\234Intelligence\342\200\235 panels where appropriate so judges understand why the system made a decision.\n\nDo not use long explanations.\nMake the intelligence understandable within 3\342\200\2235 seconds of viewing each issue."
    items {
      text: "Now strengthen the prototype\'s UNIQUE PRODUCT DIFFERENTIATORS.\n\nDo not redesign the entire application.\n\nMake these concepts visibly understandable inside the existing UI:\n\n1. REPORT \342\211\240 ISSUE\n\nShow that multiple citizen reports can be consolidated into one physical civic issue.\n\nExample:\n\342\200\23442 Citizen Reports\342\200\235\n\342\206\222\n\342\200\2341 Canonical Civic Issue\342\200\235\n\n2. AI TRIAGE\n\nShow:\nIssue classification confidence\nDuplicate probability\nSpam/trust score\nPriority score\n\n3. JURISDICTION INTELLIGENCE\n\nShow:\nGPS\n\342\206\222 Ward\n\342\206\222 Municipality\n\342\206\222 Responsible Department\n\342\206\222 Field Team\n\n4. CAPACITY-AWARE PRIORITIZATION\n\nShow why an issue is prioritized using:\nSeverity\nCitizen impact\nNumber of reports\nLocation risk\nSLA\nDepartment workload\n\n5. EVIDENCE-BACKED RESOLUTION\n\nShow:\nBefore photo\n+\nAfter photo\n+\nCompletion timestamp\n\n6. CITIZEN-VERIFIED CLOSURE\n\nShow:\nDepartment marks resolved\n\342\206\222 Citizen verifies\n\342\206\222 Closed\n\nor:\nCitizen rejects\n\342\206\222 Reopened\n\n7. RECURRING INFRASTRUCTURE INTELLIGENCE\n\nShow:\nRepeated issues at the same location over time\n\342\206\222 Hotspot\n\342\206\222 Preventive maintenance recommendation\n\nUse compact \342\200\234Why?\342\200\235 / \342\200\234Intelligence\342\200\235 panels where appropriate so judges understand why the system made a decision.\n\nDo not use long explanations.\nMake the intelligence understandable within 3\342\200\2235 seconds of viewing each issue."
    }
  }
}
