nce.\n\n6. **CITIZEN-VERIFIED CLOSURE**\n   * **Citizen Detail View:** When the notification is tapped, a highly visible \"Verify Resolution\" card anchors the screen. It forces the citizen to compare the Before/After photos and either click **\"Confirm Resolution\"** (closing it) or **\"Not Resolved \342\200\224 Reopen\"**.\n\n7. **RECURRING INFRASTRUCTURE INTELLIGENCE**\n   * **Analytics View:** Overhauled the Hotspots section into **\"Recurring Infrastructure Intelligence\"**.\n   * Instead of just showing numbers, Ward 37 now displays a critical **AI Recommendation: Preventive Road Resurfacing**. It explains in one sentence: *\"Pothole recurrence rate is 430% above city baseline. Structural intervention required.\"* (Ward 12 similarly recommends a Sewer Line Audit).\n\nThese additions are completely functional within the local simulated state and explicitly translate complex backend AI concepts into front-end visual proof for your demonstration."
