    user_response: "Now improve ONLY the municipal/government side from an OPERATIONAL perspective.\n\nThe dashboard should help a municipal officer answer these questions immediately:\n\n- What needs attention right now?\n- Which issues are critical?\n- Which department owns them?\n- Who is assigned?\n- Which SLAs are about to expire?\n- Which issues are overdue?\n- Where are the problem hotspots?\n- Which issues have been reopened by citizens?\n- Which departments have the largest backlog?\n\nAdd/strengthen:\n\n- Priority queue\n- SLA countdowns\n- Department workload\n- Assignment status\n- Escalation indicators\n- Reopened issue alerts\n- Duplicate cluster indicators\n- Citizen report counts\n- Map clustering\n- Before/after resolution evidence\n- Quick actions such as Assign, Reassign, Escalate, Start Work, Mark Resolved\n\nEnsure the dashboard remains dense but readable.\n\nDo not add decorative widgets that do not support municipal decision-making."
    items {
      text: "Now improve ONLY the municipal/government side from an OPERATIONAL perspective.\n\nThe dashboard should help a municipal officer answer these questions immediately:\n\n- What needs attention right now?\n- Which issues are critical?\n- Which department owns them?\n- Who is assigned?\n- Which SLAs are about to expire?\n- Which issues are overdue?\n- Where are the problem hotspots?\n- Which issues have been reopened by citizens?\n- Which departments have the largest backlog?\n\nAdd/strengthen:\n\n- Priority queue\n- SLA countdowns\n- Department workload\n- Assignment status\n- Escalation indicators\n- Reopened issue alerts\n- Duplicate cluster indicators\n- Citizen report counts\n- Map clustering\n- Before/after resolution evidence\n- Quick actions such as Assign, Reassign, Escalate, Start Work, Mark Resolved\n\nEnsure the dashboard remains dense but readable.\n\nDo not add decorative widgets that do not support municipal decision-making."
