  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Simplifying Citizen Experience**\n\nI\'m focusing intently on streamlining the user journey within `ReportFlow.tsx`, aiming for a rapid, intuitive reporting process. The goal is a one-minute reporting time for less digitally adept citizens, achieved by minimizing fields and cognitive strain. My core approach is now: Photo, Location, Description, Submit. I\'m prioritizing brevity and clarity.\n\n\n**Refining Language Support**\n\nI\'ve expanded language options to include English, Tamil, and Hindi, alongside voice input and offline functionality. I\'m prioritizing the user\'s comprehension. Now, I\'m working on simplifying the AI-assisted classification without burdening the user with technical jargon. I need to keep large touch targets, clear language, minimal forms, and a very obvious next action. I am also working on simplifying the AI triage panel.\n\n\n**Analyzing User Feedback**\n\nI\'m now focused on refining the UI feedback during the reporting process. I\'m prioritizing clear, concise updates to the user. I\'m working to highlight duplicate checks, and show the destination of the report with strong visual cues. I\'m currently using a bold font and blue tones to provide clear updates.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 852200572
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
