steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
  status: CORTEX_STEP_STATUS_DONE
  metadata {
    created_at {
      seconds: 1787827951
      nanos: 797374576
    }
    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "IMPORTANT: Modify ONLY the authentication flow of the existing\n\342\200\234Crowd Sourced Civic Issue Reporting and Resolution\342\200\235 prototype.\n\nThe current prototype asks for a mobile number and sends an OTP. This is blocking the demo because no real OTP is being delivered.\n\nFor the CURRENT HACKATHON PROTOTYPE, DO NOT SEND REAL SMS OR OTPs.\n\n==================================================\nAUTHENTICATION SHOULD BE DEMO / SIMULATION ONLY\n==================================================\n\nReplace the current real OTP-dependent flow with a simulated authentication experience.\n\nThe purpose is to DEMONSTRATE that the platform has verified-user authentication without requiring an actual SMS service.\n\nCitizen flow:\n\nCreate / Verify Account\n\342\206\223\nEnter Mobile Number\n\342\206\223\nContinue\n\342\206\223\nShow simulated verification state\n\342\206\223\n\342\200\234\342\234\223 Mobile Number Verified\342\200\235\n\342\206\223\nAadhaar Verification (Demo)\n\342\206\223\n\342\200\234\342\234\223 Identity Verified\342\200\235\n\342\206\223\nAccount Created\n\342\206\223\nEnter Citizen Dashboard\n\nIMPORTANT:\nThe user must NEVER be blocked waiting for an actual OTP.\n\n==================================================\nMOBILE NUMBER STEP\n==================================================\n\nKeep the mobile number field because the UI should demonstrate that the account is associated with a verified phone number.\n\nAfter the user enters any valid-looking Indian mobile number and clicks:\n\n\342\200\234Continue\342\200\235\n\nDO NOT send an SMS.\n\nInstead immediately show:\n\n\342\200\234Demo Verification\342\200\235\n\nMessage:\n\n\342\200\234For this prototype, mobile verification is simulated.\342\200\235\n\nThen show:\n\n\342\234\223 Mobile Number Verified\n\nButton:\n\n\342\200\234Continue\342\200\235\n\n==================================================\nAADHAAR VERIFICATION\n==================================================\n\nKeep the Aadhaar verification step as a DEMO ONLY.\n\nDo NOT contact UIDAI.\nDo NOT send OTP.\nDo NOT require a real Aadhaar number.\nDo NOT require an Aadhaar document upload.\n\nShow:\n\n\342\200\234Aadhaar Verification \342\200\224 Demo\342\200\235\n\nMasked mock value:\n\nXXXX XXXX 1234\n\nButton:\n\n\342\200\234Verify Identity\342\200\235\n\nWhen clicked, immediately show:\n\n\342\234\223 Identity Verified\n\nThen:\n\n\342\200\234Your CivicPulse account has been verified.\342\200\235\n\nIMPORTANT:\nDo not use the name \342\200\234CivicPulse\342\200\235.\n\nThe official product name MUST remain:\n\n\342\200\234Crowd Sourced Civic Issue Reporting and Resolution\342\200\235\n\n==================================================\nONE-CLICK DEMO AUTHENTICATION\n==================================================\n\nMake the entire onboarding process smooth enough that a judge can complete it in seconds.\n\nSuggested flow:\n\nEnter mobile number\n\342\206\222 Continue\n\342\206\222 Mobile Verified\n\342\206\222 Continue\n\342\206\222 Aadhaar Demo Verification\n\342\206\222 Verify Identity\n\342\206\222 Account Created\n\342\206\222 Dashboard\n\nNo real OTP.\nNo waiting.\nNo SMS API.\nNo external authentication provider.\n\n==================================================\nPERSISTENT LOGIN\n==================================================\n\nAfter successful demo verification:\n\nSet a persistent authenticated state using localStorage.\n\nExample:\n\nauthenticated = true\n\nStore a mock user profile such as:\n\nName:\nArun Kumar\n\nMobile:\n+91 XXXXX XXXXX\n\nIdentity:\nAadhaar Verified\n\nVerification Status:\nVerified\n\nWhen the browser/page is refreshed:\n\nIf authenticated == true\n\n\342\206\222 Automatically open the Citizen Dashboard.\n\nDo NOT show the login screen again.\n\nThe user should remain signed in until they explicitly select:\n\n\342\200\234Sign Out\342\200\235\n\n==================================================\nPROFILE DISPLAY\n==================================================\n\nKeep the authenticated user\'s profile visible in the top-right corner.\n\nShow:\n\nArun Kumar\n\342\234\223 Verified Citizen\n\nClicking the profile should open:\n\nProfile\nMy Reports\nNotifications\nPrivacy & Security\nSign Out\n\n==================================================\nIMPORTANT DEMO LABEL\n==================================================\n\nAdd a subtle but clear label somewhere in the authentication UI:\n\n\342\200\234Demo Mode \342\200\224 Identity verification simulated\342\200\235\n\nThis prevents judges from assuming the prototype is actually communicating with UIDAI or an SMS provider.\n\n==================================================\nREMOVE BLOCKING BEHAVIOUR\n==================================================\n\nCompletely remove any behavior that:\n\n- Waits for a real OTP\n- Requires an SMS to arrive\n- Calls an SMS provider\n- Requires OTP verification from an external service\n- Prevents the user from proceeding because an OTP was not received\n\nThe prototype must be fully usable without any external authentication service.\n\n==================================================\nDO NOT CHANGE ANYTHING ELSE\n==================================================\n\nDo NOT modify:\n\n- Citizen dashboard\n- Government dashboard\n- AI features\n- Duplicate detection\n- Spam detection\n- Priority engine\n- Department routing\n- Workflow\n- Analytics\n- Privacy/face-blurring feature\n- Existing visual design\n- Existing navigation\n\nOnly modify the authentication flow so that it is a seamless simulated verification experience for the hackathon prototype.\n\nFINAL EXPECTED EXPERIENCE:\n\nFirst visit:\nCreate Account\n\342\206\222 Mobile Demo Verification\n\342\206\222 Aadhaar Demo Verification\n\342\206\222 Account Created\n\342\206\222 Dashboard\n\nReturning visit:\nOpen application\n\342\206\222 Automatically authenticated\n\342\206\222 Dashboard\n\nNo real OTP should ever be required."
    items {
      text: "IMPORTANT: Modify ONLY the authentication flow of the existing\n\342\200\234Crowd Sourced Civic Issue Reporting and Resolution\342\200\235 prototype.\n\nThe current prototype asks for a mobile number and sends an OTP. This is blocking the demo because no real OTP is being delivered.\n\nFor the CURRENT HACKATHON PROTOTYPE, DO NOT SEND REAL SMS OR OTPs.\n\n==================================================\nAUTHENTICATION SHOULD BE DEMO / SIMULATION ONLY\n==================================================\n\nReplace the current real OTP-dependent flow with a simulated authentication experience.\n\nThe purpose is to DEMONSTRATE that the platform has verified-user authentication without requiring an actual SMS service.\n\nCitizen flow:\n\nCreate / Verify Account\n\342\206\223\nEnter Mobile Number\n\342\206\223\nContinue\n\342\206\223\nShow simulated verification state\n\342\206\223\n\342\200\234\342\234\223 Mobile Number Verified\342\200\235\n\342\206\223\nAadhaar Verification (Demo)\n\342\206\223\n\342\200\234\342\234\223 Identity Verified\342\200\235\n\342\206\223\nAccount Created\n\342\206\223\nEnter Citizen Dashboard\n\nIMPORTANT:\nThe user must NEVER be blocked waiting for an actual OTP.\n\n==================================================\nMOBILE NUMBER STEP\n==================================================\n\nKeep the mobile number field because the UI should demonstrate that the account is associated with a verified phone number.\n\nAfter the user enters any valid-looking Indian mobile number and clicks:\n\n\342\200\234Continue\342\200\235\n\nDO NOT send an SMS.\n\nInstead immediately show:\n\n\342\200\234Demo Verification\342\200\235\n\nMessage:\n\n\342\200\234For this prototype, mobile verification is simulated.\342\200\235\n\nThen show:\n\n\342\234\223 Mobile Number Verified\n\nButton:\n\n\342\200\234Continue\342\200\235\n\n==================================================\nAADHAAR VERIFICATION\n==================================================\n\nKeep the Aadhaar verification step as a DEMO ONLY.\n\nDo NOT contact UIDAI.\nDo NOT send OTP.\nDo NOT require a real Aadhaar number.\nDo NOT require an Aadhaar document upload.\n\nShow:\n\n\342\200\234Aadhaar Verification \342\200\224 Demo\342\200\235\n\nMasked mock value:\n\nXXXX XXXX 1234\n\nButton:\n\n\342\200\234Verify Identity\342\200\235\n\nWhen clicked, immediately show:\n\n\342\234\223 Identity Verified\n\nThen:\n\n\342\200\234Your CivicPulse account has been verified.\342\200\235\n\nIMPORTANT:\nDo not use the name \342\200\234CivicPulse\342\200\235.\n\nThe official product name MUST remain:\n\n\342\200\234Crowd Sourced Civic Issue Reporting and Resolution\342\200\235\n\n==================================================\nONE-CLICK DEMO AUTHENTICATION\n==================================================\n\nMake the entire onboarding process smooth enough that a judge can complete it in seconds.\n\nSuggested flow:\n\nEnter mobile number\n\342\206\222 Continue\n\342\206\222 Mobile Verified\n\342\206\222 Continue\n\342\206\222 Aadhaar Demo Verification\n\342\206\222 Verify Identity\n\342\206\222 Account Created\n\342\206\222 Dashboard\n\nNo real OTP.\nNo waiting.\nNo SMS API.\nNo external authentication provider.\n\n==================================================\nPERSISTENT LOGIN\n==================================================\n\nAfter successful demo verification:\n\nSet a persistent authenticated state using localStorage.\n\nExample:\n\nauthenticated = true\n\nStore a mock user profile such as:\n\nName:\nArun Kumar\n\nMobile:\n+91 XXXXX XXXXX\n\nIdentity:\nAadhaar Verified\n\nVerification Status:\nVerified\n\nWhen the browser/page is refreshed:\n\nIf authenticated == true\n\n\342\206\222 Automatically open the Citizen Dashboard.\n\nDo NOT show the login screen again.\n\nThe user should remain signed in until they explicitly select:\n\n\342\200\234Sign Out\342\200\235\n\n==================================================\nPROFILE DISPLAY\n==================================================\n\nKeep the authenticated user\'s profile visible in the top-right corner.\n\nShow:\n\nArun Kumar\n\342\234\223 Verified Citizen\n\nClicking the profile should open:\n\nProfile\nMy Reports\nNotifications\nPrivacy & Security\nSign Out\n\n==================================================\nIMPORTANT DEMO LABEL\n==================================================\n\nAdd a subtle but clear label somewhere in the authentication UI:\n\n\342\200\234Demo Mode \342\200\224 Identity verification simulated\342\200\235\n\nThis prevents judges from assuming the prototype is actually communicating with UIDAI or an SMS provider.\n\n==================================================\nREMOVE BLOCKING BEHAVIOUR\n==================================================\n\nCompletely remove any behavior that:\n\n- Waits for a real OTP\n- Requires an SMS to arrive\n- Calls an SMS provider\n- Requires OTP verification from an external service\n- Prevents the user from proceeding because an OTP was not received\n\nThe prototype must be fully usable without any external authentication service.\n\n==================================================\nDO NOT CHANGE ANYTHING ELSE\n==================================================\n\nDo NOT modify:\n\n- Citizen dashboard\n- Government dashboard\n- AI features\n- Duplicate detection\n- Spam detection\n- Priority engine\n- Department routing\n- Workflow\n- Analytics\n- Privacy/face-blurring feature\n- Existing visual design\n- Existing navigation\n\nOnly modify the authentication flow so that it is a seamless simulated verification experience for the hackathon prototype.\n\nFINAL EXPECTED EXPERIENCE:\n\nFirst visit:\nCreate Account\n\342\206\222 Mobile Demo Verification\n\342\206\222 Aadhaar Demo Verification\n\342\206\222 Account Created\n\342\206\222 Dashboard\n\nReturning visit:\nOpen application\n\342\206\222 Automatically authenticated\n\342\206\222 Dashboard\n\nNo real OTP should ever be required."
    }
  }
