dhaar Verification \342\200\224 Demo</span>\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"p-6 space-y-4\">\n                <div>\n                  <label className=\"block text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 mb-2\">Masked Aadhaar</label>\n                  <input \n                    type=\"text\" \n                    className=\"w-full border-2 border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-lg font-bold outline-none bg-slate-50\"\n                    placeholder=\"XXXX XXXX 1234\"\n                    value={aadhaar}\n                    onChange={(e) => setAadhaar(e.target.value)}\n                  />\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                  <label className=\"block text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 mb-2\">6-digit OTP</label>\n                  <input \n                    type=\"text\" \n                    className=\"w-full border-2 border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center tracking-[1em] text-2xl font-bold focus:border-blue-500 outline-none\"\n                    placeholder=\"------\"\n                    maxLength={6}\n                    value={aadhaarOtp}\n                    onChange={(e) => setAadhaarOtp(e.target.value)}\n                  />\n                </div>\n                <button \n                  onClick={handleAadhaarSubmit}\n                  className=\"w-full bg-slate-900 text-white py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg active:scale-95 transition-transform mt-2\"\n                >\n                  Verify Identity\n                </button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-6 text-center px-4\">\n              Your Aadhaar number is not displayed publicly. The prototype stores only a verified-account state and non-sensitive profile information.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        )}"
