  planner_response {
    response: "I have successfully updated the authentication flow for the Hackathon Prototype exactly as requested.\n\nHere is an overview of the simulated authentication integration:\n\n- **Frictionless Demo Identity Flow**: The entire citizen onboarding pipeline has been optimized for rapid, one-click presentation. The blocking SMS API constraints have been fully stripped out. \n- **Demo Mode Transparency**: An active \"Demo Mode \342\200\224 Identity verification simulated\" badge is now visible at the top of the authentication flow. This cleanly signals to judges that the prototype successfully implements the *architecture* of verified identity without exposing the system to live OTP wait-times during the presentation.\n- **Simulated Mobile Verification**: Submitting a mobile number immediately transitions to a verified state with a clear visual \"\342\234\223 Mobile Number Verified\" message, removing any necessity for real-world SMS delivery.\n- **Mock Aadhaar Validation**: The Aadhaar stage displays a masked `XXXX XXXX 1234` value and bypasses the external API validation, immediately providing the user with a \"\342\234\223 Identity Verified\" completion badge and routing them into the core experience.\n- **Persistent Authenticated State**: Behind the scenes, the browser securely records the \"Arun Kumar\" verified state into its local session (`localStorage`). Any page refresh or returning visit immediately bypasses the login portal and loads directly into the Citizen Dashboard.\n- **Consistent Nomenclature**: Verified that the product strictly retains its official title (\"Crowd Sourced Civic Issue Reporting and Resolution\") without reverting to the deprecated \"CivicPulse\" moniker.\n\nThe application continues to build completely green, and your priority features\342\200\224including the new automated Privacy Face-Blurring module\342\200\224remain fully operational. The prototype is primed for a flawless live demonstration!"
    thinking: "**Confirming Success and Flow**\n\nI\'m pleased to report the build was successful. I\'ve now integrated the requested changes, resulting in the desired demo flow. Specifically, I\'ve replaced the OTP inputs with immediate states and information messages, which are ideal for the prototype. Furthermore, a highly visible \"Demo Mode \342\200\224 Identity\" indicator was added.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have successfully updated the authentication flow for the Hackathon Prototype exactly as requested.\n\nHere is an overview of the simulated authentication integration:\n\n- **Frictionless Demo Identity Flow**: The entire citizen onboarding pipeline has been optimized for rapid, one-click presentation. The blocking SMS API constraints have been fully stripped out. \n- **Demo Mode Transparency**: An active \"Demo Mode \342\200\224 Identity verification simulated\" badge is now visible at the top of the authentication flow. This cleanly signals to judges that the prototype successfully implements the *architecture* of verified identity without exposing the system to live OTP wait-times during the presentation.\n- **Simulated Mobile Verification**: Submitting a mobile number immediately transitions to a verified state with a clear visual \"\342\234\223 Mobile Number Verified\" message, removing any necessity for real-world SMS delivery.\n- **Mock Aadhaar Validation**: The Aadhaar stage displays a masked `XXXX XXXX 1234` value and bypasses the external API validation, immediately providing the user with a \"\342\234\223 Identity Verified\" completion badge and routing them into the core experience.\n- **Persistent Authenticated State**: Behind the scenes, the browser securely records the \"Arun Kumar\" verified state into its local session (`localStorage`). Any page refresh or returning visit immediately bypasses the login portal and loads directly into the Citizen Dashboard.\n- **Consistent Nomenclature**: Verified that the product strictly retains its official title (\"Crowd Sourced Civic Issue Reporting and Resolution\") without reverting to the deprecated \"CivicPulse\" moniker.\n\nThe application continues to build completely green, and your priority features\342\200\224including the new automated Privacy Face-Blurring module\342\200\224remain fully operational. The prototype is primed for a flawless live demonstration!"
