  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Revising Sign-Out Procedure**\n\nI\'ve been wrestling with the sign-out flow. The core issue revolves around role selection post-logout. Instead of immediately redirecting to the login form, users signing out of Citizen or Government roles need to hit a Role Selection screen first. This feels like the right direction to improve the experience.\n\n\n**Implementing Role Selection**\n\nI\'ve made progress on the Role Selection screen within `AuthFlow.tsx`. I\'ve added the buttons to the profile menus as well. I\'m now working to ensure the sign-out flow correctly directs users to this screen after logout, so they can select the appropriate role.\n\n\n"
