\">Account created successfully.</p>                        <button               onClick={finishCitizenOnboarding}              className=\"w-full bg-blue-600 text-white py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg shadow-xl active:scale-95 transition-transform\"            >              Continue to CSCIRR            </button>          </div>        )}      </div>    </div>  );};"
