    thinking: "**Confirming Completion and Fixes**\n\nI\'m feeling good about this run; it should wrap up without a hitch. Just did a final sweep of those fixes. The manual map pin issue is sorted thanks to react-leaflet in ReportFlow.tsx, and the stray cattle report now shows the right image, updated in src/data.ts. It\'s looking like we\'re golden.\n\n\n**Addressing Role and Language**\n\nI\'ve tackled the role switching issue; Citizens can\'t jump roles anymore, and all \"Exit to Role Selection\" options are gone. Language selection is now geolocation-based, thanks to AppContext.tsx and some neat state mapping logic for India. I\'ve also implemented secure identity hashing in AuthFlow.tsx and integrated a privacy section in Profile.tsx. Sign Out is finally fixed, that was an easy one!\n\n\n"
