  planner_response {
    response: "I have found the root cause of the Sign Out issue and fixed it!\n\n**The cause:** The sign-out buttons were using the native browser `window.confirm(\"Are you sure you want to sign out?\")` dialog. Because the application preview runs securely inside an iframe in this environment, native alert and confirm dialogs are blocked by the browser to prevent hijacking. This caused the click event to silently fail without ever reaching the actual logout function.\n\n**The fix:** I have completely stripped out `window.confirm()` and implemented clean, custom modal overlays for both the Citizen Profile and the Government Portal. \n\nWhen you click \"Sign Out\" now, an in-app confirmation modal will slide up. Clicking \"Sign Out\" inside that modal will successfully wipe your session from memory and instantly route you back to the Role Selection screen. \n\nThe update is deployed and the dev server has restarted\342\200\224you can test it right away!"
    modified_response: "I have found the root cause of the Sign Out issue and fixed it!\n\n**The cause:** The sign-out buttons were using the native browser `window.confirm(\"Are you sure you want to sign out?\")` dialog. Because the application preview runs securely inside an iframe in this environment, native alert and confirm dialogs are blocked by the browser to prevent hijacking. This caused the click event to silently fail without ever reaching the actual logout function.\n\n**The fix:** I have completely stripped out `window.confirm()` and implemented clean, custom modal overlays for both the Citizen Profile and the Government Portal. \n\nWhen you click \"Sign Out\" now, an in-app confirmation modal will slide up. Clicking \"Sign Out\" inside that modal will successfully wipe your session from memory and instantly route you back to the Role Selection screen. \n\nThe update is deployed and the dev server has restarted\342\200\224you can test it right away!"
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
